# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:5
translate italian u20g_2257ecc3:

    # "I drive over to Juliana's house and knock on her door."
    "Guido fino a casa di Juliana e busso alla sua porta."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:6
translate italian u20g_4fc89239:

    # "It's late and I hate to wake her, but I need to see her."
    "È tardi e mi dispiace svegliarla, ma ho bisogno di vederla."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:9
translate italian u20g_5ac21d19:

    # "Juliana's grandmother comes to the door, looking surprised."
    "La nonna di Juliana viene alla porta, con aria sorpresa."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:10
translate italian u20g_12baa67b:

    # jg "Oh you're Juliana's friend... I'm sorry, I forgot your name."
    jg "Oh, sei l’amico di Juliana... Mi dispiace, ho dimenticato il tuo nome."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:11
translate italian u20g_529f52b6:

    # pc "It's [pcname]."
    pc "Mi chiamo [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:12
translate italian u20g_0a7b8aae:

    # jg "What happened to your hair, boy? You miss a barber appointment?"
    jg "Che ti è successo ai capelli, ragazzo? Hai saltato l’appuntamento dal barbiere?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:13
translate italian u20g_84c963f6:

    # pc "I'm sorry. I know it's late, but can I see Juliana?"
    pc "Mi dispiace. So che è tardi, ma posso vedere Juliana?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:14
translate italian u20g_975fcca2:

    # jg "Oh, it's okay. I was up watching Love Island. You know that show?"
    jg "Oh, va bene. Ero sveglia a guardare Love Island. Conosci quel programma?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:17
translate italian u20g_70d520dc:

    # jg "I just love all the drama with sexy people trying to get in each other's pants."
    jg "Adoro tutti quei drammi con gente sexy che cerca di portarsi a letto l’uno l’altro."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:18
translate italian u20g_5ab1c947:

    # jg "Anyway, come in. Yeah, you can go up to see Juliana."
    jg "Comunque, entra pure. Sì, puoi salire a trovare Juliana."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:19
translate italian u20g_60d8396d:

    # jg "I'll turn up the volume on the TV, so you two can have some privacy."
    jg "Alzo il volume della TV, così voi due potrete avere un po’ di privacy."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:20
translate italian u20g_c6880d17:

    # pc "Thanks!"
    pc "Grazie!"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:24
translate italian u20g_ea76bd5b:

    # "I walk quietly up the stairs and into Juliana's room. She's in bed, sleeping."
    "Salgo silenziosamente le scale ed entro nella stanza di Juliana. È a letto, che dorme."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:27
translate italian u20g_a95bfc0c:

    # "Trying not to wake her immediately, I lie next to her and wrap her in my arms."
    "Cercando di non svegliarla subito, mi sdraio accanto a lei e la stringo tra le braccia."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:30
translate italian u20g_c981bd85:

    # "She jolts awake and looks at me, shocked."
    "Si sveglia di soprassalto e mi guarda, scioccata."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:31
translate italian u20g_c026970e:

    # bn "[pcname]? Is it really you?"
    bn "[pcname]? Sei davvero tu?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:32
translate italian u20g_7f340d6d:

    # pc "It's really me."
    pc "Sono proprio io."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:35
translate italian u20g_b5e336f8:

    # "She leans in and kisses me deeply, her lips soft and warm against mine."
    "Si avvicina e mi bacia appassionatamente, le sue labbra morbide e calde contro le mie."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:36
translate italian u20g_df5fc180:

    # bn "Oh, I missed you so much."
    bn "Oh, mi sei mancato tantissimo."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:39
translate italian u20g_cfc15aa3:

    # bn "So everything was true? You really saw your dad?"
    bn "Allora era tutto vero? Hai davvero visto tuo padre?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:40
translate italian u20g_e5c0f2f9:

    # pc "Yeah, I did. It's all true. I'll tell you all about it tomorrow."
    pc "Sì, l’ho visto. È tutto vero. Domani ti racconterò tutto."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:43
translate italian u20g_2b545022:

    # bn "I'm just glad you're back. I was so worried about you."
    bn "Sono solo felice che tu sia tornato. Ero così preoccupata per te."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:44
translate italian u20g_98d08bed:

    # bn "You look and smell awful though."
    bn "Hai un aspetto e un odore orribili, però."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:47
translate italian u20g_4aea05d2:

    # bn "I'll go get the bathroom ready for you."
    bn "Vado a prepararti il bagno."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20g.rpy:48
translate italian u20g_a3acbba5:

    # bn "If you're going to stay the night in my bed, you need to shower and shave."
    bn "Se hai intenzione di passare la notte nel mio letto, devi farti una doccia e raderti."

